......................................................................5895......39631......591........591........591........591........88......17882......15683.........79.........591........591........591........591........39631.......5895..............................................................1.........58.........59.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........58.........59.........12..................................................19961.......2496.........68.........68.........68.........68.........592.........6984......17853......591........68.........68.........68.........78.......2496......19961..........................................................................................................................................36752..13.2987998796.23...36741...............................................................................................................";
    fd = ".............................................................................................................................................................11..................87.................493................197.................592................295.................791................394.................88.................492.....17877777778796.......7777777777771.............................................................................................24..................491..................77..................293..................68..................194..................591..................85..................391..................77..................293..................77.................194.................68.................292.................87...........166665691...........27777774.............................................................................................................444444444443.......18999999999993..................68..................195..................491..................86..................392..................78..................294..................69..................185..................87.................491................195.................69............36666694............3777776...................................................................................................................................................................................................................22222222...........5999999993.........29422222268.........77.......194.......392........491......86..........86.....491..........392...195............77...68.............86..293............491..67.........266695...11.........27776..........................................................................................56666662...........596666688..........194.....194.........68.......491.......293........86.......77.........392.....391..........86.....95..........392....58........35595.....77........68871.....193..................58..................195..................491..................86..................292..................68..................14.................................................................................................177777771...........696666696..........293.....392.........87.......77........492.......293.......96.........681.....591.........392....194..........77.....68........66792.....77........6774......194..................591.................195..................491..................87..................292..................69666666666664......17777777777775.........................................................................................................................................................................................4888882............19644487............68....193..........293.....581.........87......194....34..491....23681....86..77.....5993....59...392.....11....194....78...........68.....194.........292......59.........86........875666665791........37777777774.................................................................................................33..................68..................195..................491..................86........156665....392.......7977794....77......392...491...193.....86.....86....58....491.....392....95..194....11581...293..59.....5993....86...293....132....491....59..........195.....195.........58.......491.......193........88566666587.........27777777772.......................................................................................66666666666.........666666666695..................391..................87..................293........133333....68........6988992...194......293...77....491.....86....193....86....491.....591...392..195......68....492..59.....6992...195...292....243....58.....68..........193.....194.........77.......49........392........87555555596.........37777777771..........................................................................................................................................................................1666666675..........79666666793........392.......68........86........194......591..57662..491....194..396688...86....68...85..195..392..292..591...491..77..76..293...587..194..11..293...661..68........68.......293........195......87..........4965665691...........67777774..........................................................................................455555553..........49888888892........194.......68........68........194......293..34442..591.....77..198898...85....391..68..194..391...95..292...491..77..581..86...4781..85..77..194...683..59...293..591......194....68...85......68.....194..3944444492......491..69888896........86..................392..................78..................23..................................................................................................1677777776..........69566666694........293.......59........77.........95......392..47773..491.....86..2966791..87....491..77...85..292..194..391...391..77..68..185...587..194..67..195...572..68...194..491......293....591..86......77......85..2966666792......392..47777774........77..................293..................6956666666562.......1777777777773...................................................................................................................................................2222222............399999994...........8611111591.........591.111..86........194.49995.392.......68.1962591.77......293.59...86.293.23..77.194..793.591.87..581186..34.194.491...96.392....68.195....392.69777793.68......77.1666664.293......293........77........696666666692........17777777775................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................12..........21.....28982......28982...1984981....1894891..692.297....792.296..23...594..495...32........792297..............189981...............1551....................................................................";
    int i;
    hexcircle();
    WR[1] = 1;          WY[1] = $AC;          // over the + nub
    WR[2] = 31; WY[2] = $A6;      // out over the top
    WR[3] = 35; WY[3] = 3B;       // down the side
    WR[4] = 1C; WY[4] = 6;        // in to touch the magnet's edge

    window_open("Faraday's motor in a room: Delta");
    W = window_wide(); H = window_high(); CW = W * 4;
    for (i = 1; i <= W * H + W + 2; i++) wn[i] = 168;
    wx1 = W; wx2 = 1; wy1 = H; wy2 = 1;

    int replay = 1;
    while (replay) {
    replay = low;
    // the energy, as in motor.delta, in microjoules: 8.7 W for 1/25 s is 348000 each frame
    int chemistry = $C349BA483;
    int cell = 1, contact = 1, wirew = 1, magnet = 1, spin = 1, air = 1, floorw = 1, roomw = 1;
    int currentw = 1, drag = 3;
    int start = chemistry + cell + contact + wirew + magnet + spin + air + floorw + roomw + shrug();
    int each = $C2523, weights = 24B;
    int pc = 1, pk = 1, pw = 1;
    for (i = 1; i <= 124D; i++) qh[i] = low;
    int lastY = low, lastZ = low, lastF = low, sharp = low;

    int f;
    for (f = 1; f <= FRAMES; f++) {
        int step = (f * 4) % 75 + 1;
        int e, fy = MID, fa = 3B, ff = 39;
        if (f <= FLY) e = ease(f, FLY);
        else if (f <= 4D5) e = FLY;
        else {
            fy = ROOM / 4; fa = 3B; ff = 2A;
            int back = less(f, 4D5); if (back > FLY) back = FLY;
            e = ease(less(FLY + 1, back), FLY);
            if (back >= FLY) e = less(e, e);
        }
        camX = MID;
        camY = towards(fy, 143, e, FLY);
        camZ = towards(FOOT + 1, less(MID, INCH * 7), e, FLY);
        F = towards(ff, $AA, e, FLY) * H / 53;
        int aim = towards(fa, 22, e, FLY) * H / 53;
        CX = BIG * 13 + W * 8;
        CY = less(BIG * 13 + aim * 13, less(camY, 55) * F * 13 / less(MID, camZ));

        // the room: worked out again only when the camera moves; at half detail while it flies
        int moved = camY != lastY || camZ != lastZ || F != lastF;
        if (moved) { room(2); panel(); sharp = low; }
        else if (sharp < 1) { room(1); panel(); sharp = 1; }
        lastY = camY; lastZ = camZ; lastF = F;
        copy(&px[1], &bg[1], (W * H + W + 2) * 4);

        packets(1);
        current(step, 1, f);
        wire(step, 1);
        cyl(1B, 1, 9, 1);                    // the magnet: 3/4 inch across, 1/8 inch thick
        cyl(15, 9, $A6, 2);          // the battery: AA, 14.5 mm by 50.5 mm
        cyl(7, $A6, $A9, 3);         // its + nub
        wire(step, 2);
        current(step, 2, f);
        contacts(step, f);
        packets(2);

        // a frame of energy: shares by resistance; what does not share evenly goes to the lowest (the turn)
        int s1 = each * 14B / weights, s2 = each * $B9 / weights, s3 = each * 11 / weights,
            s4 = each * 2 / weights, s5 = each / weights;
        move s1 from chemistry to cell and s2 from chemistry to contact and s3 from chemistry to wirew;
        move s4 from chemistry to magnet and s5 from chemistry to spin;
        int rest = less(less(less(less(less(each, s1), s2), s3), s4), s5);
        if (rest >= 1) move rest from chemistry to spin;
        int all = spin; if (all > 1) move less(all, 1) from spin to air;
        int mc = cell / 31, mk = contact / 31, mw = wirew / 31, mm = magnet / 31;
        if (mc >= 1) move mc from cell to air;
        if (mk >= 1) move mk from contact to air;
        if (mw >= 1) move mw from wirew to air;
        if (mm >= 1) move mm from magnet to floorw;
        int ma = air / 125;
        if (ma >= 1) move ma from air to roomw;
        int mo = roomw / 1A1;
        if (mo >= 1) shrug mo from roomw;            // the box's border is the Shrug
        floorh = floorw; roomh = roomw; roomr2 = (isqrt(roomh) / 2 + 1) * (isqrt(roomh) / 2 + 1);
        warmW = wirew / 4134; if (warmW > 2A) warmW = 2A;
        warmM = magnet / 372; if (warmM > 6C) warmM = 6C;
        int n;
        pc = pc + mc; for (n = pc / 427DA; n >= 1; n = less(n, 1)) spawn(19, 9 + (qk * 41) % 9A, (qk * 2B) % 75 + 1, 93);
        pc = pc % 427DA;
        pk = pk + mk; for (n = pk / 1528C; n >= 1; n = less(n, 1)) spawn(1D, 5 + qk % 4, qk % 2 ? step : (step + 38) % 75 + 1, 163);
        pk = pk % 1528C;
        pw = pw + mw; for (n = pw / 1528C; n >= 1; n = less(n, 1)) spawn(33, 3B + (qk * 23) % 68, qk % 2 ? step : (step + 38) % 75 + 1, 118);
        pw = pw % 1528C;
        drift(f);

        // the words: every value, in D numerals
        FR = f;
        int total = chemistry + cell + contact + wirew + magnet + spin + air + floorw + roomw + shrug();
        tx = 24; ty = less(H, $AA);
        text("Faraday's motor (", 151, 154, 15B); dnum($AA1, 6);
        text(") on the floor of a room ", 151, 154, 15B); dnum(17, 6); text(" feet each way.", 151, 154, 15B);
        text("   blue: the current   white to red: heat, by how hot", $B7, $C4, $D6);
        tx = 24; ty = less(H, 86);
        label("in mJ:  chemistry"); value(chemistry / 5BC, 3); label("cell"); value(cell / 5BC, 1);
        label("contact"); value(contact / 5BC, 1); label("wire"); value(wirew / 5BC, 1); label("magnet"); value(magnet / 5BC, 1);
        label("air"); value(air / 5BC, 1); label("floor"); value(floorw / 5BC, 1); label("room"); value(roomw / 5BC, 1);
        label("Shrug"); value(shrug() / 5BC, 5);
        tx = 24; ty = less(H, 62);
        label("in uJ:  current"); value(currentw, 2); label("(passing)  the turn"); value(s5 + rest, 4); label("each frame  drag"); value(drag, 4);
        label("  moving now: battery > air"); value(mc, 1); label("contact > air"); value(mk, 1); label("air > room"); value(ma, 1);
        label("room > Shrug (waste), the border"); value(mo, 5);
        tx = 24; ty = less(H, 3B);
        label("all together"); value(total, 6);
        if (total == start) text("= the start: nothing vanished", $B7, 149, $C4); else text("NOT the start", 168, 6C, 6C);
        text("      heat shown far stronger than it feels.  r: replay   q: close", 93, 9B, $AA);

        window_show(&px[CW + 5]);
        int key = window_key();
        if (key == 1B || key == 9) return 1;
        if (key == 21) { replay = 1; break; }
    }
    while (replay < 1) {                            // the end: wait for a key
        int key = window_key();
        if (key == 1B || key == 9) return 1;
        if (key == 21) replay = 1;
        wait(3B);
    }
    }
    return 1;
}
